ent-ComputerAmsPartsOrders = AMS components console
    .desc = Lists acquisition methods for all six AMS components. Components cannot be purchased.
ent-AmsPartsOrderComputerCircuitboard = AMS components console board
    .desc = A circuitboard for an anti-mass spectrometer components console.
ams-parts-console-heading = BLACK MESA / AMS COMPONENTS
ams-parts-acquisition-tab = Acquisition
ams-parts-acquisition-title = Component acquisition
ams-parts-acquisition-AmsPartCore = Researching AMS Components ({ $points } research points) delivers one core at the research console and announces the reward. The core cannot be crafted.
ams-parts-acquisition-AmsPartCoil = Use the AMS coil fabricator. Requires a superconducting core ({ $amscoilcomponent }), { $steel } steel sheets and { $silver } silver bars. The core is intended as expedition loot.
ams-parts-acquisition-AmsPartLens = Use the AMS focusing lens fabricator. Requires an optical matrix ({ $amslenscomponent }), { $glass } glass sheets, { $silver } silver bars and { $gold } gold bars. The matrix is intended as expedition loot.
ams-parts-acquisition-AmsPartCell = Use the AMS power cell fabricator. Requires an energy module ({ $amscellcomponent }), { $steel } steel sheets, { $plastic } plastic sheets and { $uranium } uranium sheets. The module is intended as expedition loot.
ams-parts-acquisition-AmsPartStabilizer = Use the AMS stabilizer fabricator. Requires a resonance controller ({ $amsstabilizercomponent }), { $steel } steel sheets, { $glass } glass sheets and { $silver } silver bars. The controller is intended as expedition loot. A finished stabilizer can also be found in maintenance near the Xen catalyst.
ams-parts-acquisition-AmsPartCasing = Use the AMS casing fabricator. Requires a structural frame ({ $amscasingcomponent }), { $steel } steel sheets and { $plastic } plastic sheets. The frame is intended as expedition loot.
ams-parts-research-reward-description = Delivers one AMS core at the research console and announces the reward.
ams-parts-research-reward-announcement = Anti-mass spectrometer component research complete. An AMS core has been delivered at the science department research console.

ent-ComputerAmsCoilFabricator = AMS part fabricator: coil
    .desc = Manufactures an AMS coil from a superconducting core and raw materials. Requires power. Cannot be dismantled or sold.
ent-ComputerAmsLensFabricator = AMS part fabricator: lens
    .desc = Manufactures an AMS focusing lens from an optical matrix and raw materials. Requires power. Cannot be dismantled or sold.
ent-ComputerAmsCellFabricator = AMS part fabricator: power cell
    .desc = Manufactures an AMS power cell from an energy module and raw materials. Requires power. Cannot be dismantled or sold.
ent-ComputerAmsStabilizerFabricator = AMS part fabricator: stabilizer
    .desc = Manufactures an AMS stabilizer from a resonance controller and raw materials. Requires power. Cannot be dismantled or sold.
ent-ComputerAmsCasingFabricator = AMS part fabricator: casing
    .desc = Manufactures an AMS casing from a structural frame and raw materials. Requires power. Cannot be dismantled or sold.
